.SH NAME
abacus-actions - List or search action nodes


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBabacus actions [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List all action nodes in the graph with their linked route, entity, and page counts.

.PP
Use --match to search actions by name or label via FTS5. Results show how many
graph nodes of each kind are connected to each action.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for actions

.PP
\fB-l\fP, \fB--limit\fP=50
	Maximum number of results

.PP
\fB-m\fP, \fB--match\fP=""
	FTS5 search query


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--db\fP=".abacus/abacus.db"
	Path to the database file

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output in JSON format

.PP
\fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-essential output

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Enable verbose output


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  $ abacus actions
  $ abacus actions --match "create user"
  $ abacus actions --limit 20 --json
.EE


